    ['The place of torments and the flame', 'Jesus does not identify them.', 'Luke 16:23–24'],
    ['The great gulf', 'Jesus does not identify it.', 'Luke 16:26'],
    ['The five brethren and the father’s house', 'Jesus does not identify them.', 'Luke 16:27–28'],
    ['Moses and the prophets', 'Jesus does not identify them beyond the words of the account.', 'Luke 16:29, 31'],
